{"zhBackup":1,"game":"Zombie Haven","slot":1,"exported":"2026-11-25T18:07:56.814Z","version":"2.57.0","name":"Zombie Haven","day":5,"save":{"sid":"gunsn19a","version":"2.57.0","S":{"lvl":5,"lvStep":1,"lvUp":null,"banners":[],"diff":"normal","start":"camp","legacy":{},"finale":null,"won":null,"posts":[{"x":16,"y":10,"holder":"auto","sched":"night","cur":null}],"kids":[],"guide":4,"log":[{"d":4,"h":11,"t":"Amy learned First Aid (kept in every profession).","l":"routine"},{"d":4,"h":12,"t":"\ud83d\udcfb Dusk Radio: Bad news with a time on it: a boss comes with the horde at 21:00. Sharpen something.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":12,"t":"The Haven is working toward level 4: 1 h in real time (it keeps going while the app is closed, and renown can speed it up).","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":12,"t":"The land grew: new outer wall line 72 tiles. Buildings inside a closed wall: 0 of 16. Sealed needs the HQ and 3 in 4.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":12,"t":"HAVEN LEVEL 4!","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":12,"t":"\ud83d\udcfb Dusk Radio: Level 4. The zombies have noticed too. They're your biggest fans.","l":"routine"},{"d":4,"h":12,"t":"\ud83d\udcfb Dusk Radio: Visitor on the highway. Walking, not shambling. I'd open the gate.","l":"routine"},{"d":4,"h":14,"t":"Gym: all materials are in, building now.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":15,"t":"Maya was turned away at the gate.","l":"routine"},{"d":4,"h":15,"t":"Maya walks off.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":16,"t":"Gym: Lift the heavy thing","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":16,"t":"Gym built.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":17,"t":"Rain Barrel: all materials are in, building now.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":18,"t":"Rain Barrel: It rains, you drink","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":18,"t":"Rain Barrel built.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":18,"t":"Tent: all materials are in, building now.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":19,"t":"\ud83d\udcfb Dusk Radio: That's the sun done for today. Try to be here when it comes back.","l":"routine"},{"d":4,"h":19,"t":"Night falls at 20:00: more zombies, and they come for the town.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":19,"t":"Tent: Two beds and one zipper that sticks","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":19,"t":"Tent built.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":20,"t":"Rosa moved into a free bed in the Tent.","l":"routine"},{"d":4,"h":20,"t":"Noah moved into a free bed in the Tent.","l":"routine"},{"d":4,"h":20,"t":"Night falls: more zombies, and they come for the town.","l":"important"},{"d":4,"h":21,"t":"A horde of 40 zombies reaches the Haven. Its leader walks behind it.","l":"critical"},{"d":4,"h":22,"t":"Amy is trapped in the Tent while a infected dog breaks in. Fighters are answering.","l":"critical"},{"d":4,"h":22,"t":"The Gatling Boss has appeared! It walks in behind its horde of 40.","l":"critical"},{"d":4,"h":23,"t":"\ud83d\udcfb Dusk Radio: Somebody's walking up your road. Two legs, normal speed. Promising.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":0,"t":"Lena scrounged some scrap.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":0,"t":"Day 4 \u00b7 Food +16.6 \u22126.7 \u00b7 Water +11.0 \u22126.7 \u00b7 Upkeep \u22126.0 scrap \u00b7 Open staff slot: Rain Barrel, Garden Plot","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":0,"t":"Marcus collapsed! Rescue within 270 s.","l":"critical"},{"d":5,"h":1,"t":"\ud83e\ude78 Nobody is reaching Marcus: 10 zombies next to them: nobody walks in on their own \u00b7 tap Send rescue, or clear them","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":1,"t":"Theo joined the Haven!","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":1,"t":"Theo (Civilian Lv.1) joined the Haven. Collects bottle caps.","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":1,"t":"Amy is trapped in the Tent while a walker breaks in. Fighters are answering.","l":"critical"},{"d":5,"h":1,"t":"Ready for the next level: open Upgrade (tap the Renown wheel or Town) to start it.","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":1,"t":"Theo lends a hand at the Rain Barrel.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"Lena collapsed! Rescue within 270 s.","l":"critical"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"Greenwater's truck is coming down the highway (about an hour), medics on board. Stay hidden until you hear the horn.","l":"critical"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"Amy is rescuing Marcus.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"The Haven is working toward level 5: 6 h in real time (it keeps going while the app is closed, and renown can speed it up).","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"HAVEN LEVEL 5!","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"\ud83d\udcfb Dusk Radio: Word on the road: the Haven hit level 5. Somebody out there is actually organised.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"\ud83d\udcfb Dusk Radio: The next level needs a Banner over the Haven. Two ways to raise one: clear the Overrun Clinic on the Explore map, or finish a Trading Post or a Radio Tower.","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":2,"t":"\ud83d\udea9 The next level needs a Banner over the Haven. Two ways to raise one: clear the Overrun Clinic on the Explore map, or finish a Trading Post or a Radio Tower.","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":3,"t":"\ud83e\ude78 Nobody is reaching Lena: 7 zombies next to them: nobody walks in on their own \u00b7 tap Send rescue, or clear them","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":3,"t":"Ben is trapped in the Tent while a bloated breaks in. Fighters are answering.","l":"critical"},{"d":5,"h":4,"t":"Amy picked up Marcus.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":5,"t":"More of them are coming out of the dark.","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":6,"t":"Weather report: \ud83c\udf42 Heavy rain 10:00\u201312:00. Tomorrow: Heavy rain 03:00\u201305:00.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":6,"t":"16 zombies are still about from the night. In daylight they are slow and weak: the fighters go out after them.","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":6,"t":"At first light what is left of the boss's horde turns back into the dark, and the boss with it if he still stands. Every other zombie stays until it is killed.","l":"important"},{"d":5,"h":6,"t":"Dawn: fewer zombies until nightfall.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":6,"t":"Amy and Marcus are now friends.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":6,"t":"Marcus reached the Medical Tent.","l":"routine"},{"d":5,"h":6,"t":"